-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"א/1: ביצוע פסק דין של בית הדין הארצי לעבודה בעניין
-- עובדי הוראה המבוטחים בקרנות פנסיה ותיקות
-- Carrying out the National Labour Court's ruling of 23.8.2010 for teaching
-- staff of the owners of secondary schools insured in veteran pension funds:
-- the one-off compensation for over-deduction (current and former
-- employees), its interest, linkage and deadlines, and the contribution rates
-- with the employer's 15% split between severance and benefits.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשע"א/1 ביצוע פסק דין בעניין עובדי הוראה המבוטחים בקרנות פנסיה ותיקות`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (31.10.2010), addressee, greeting and subject line, and the lead-in naming the Treasury letter of 13/10/10, the ruling of 23/08/10 (סק"כ 5821-05-10) and the like compensation for new funds in circular תש"ע/1; no rule.

-- Time in this file is counted in DAYS from 31 October 2010, the date the
-- circular is signed (day 0).
`1 January 2004`     MEANS -2495
`30 September 2009`  MEANS -396
`30 November 2009`   MEANS -335
`23 November 2010`   MEANS 23
`23 December 2010`   MEANS 53

@desc A teaching employee insured in a veteran pension fund, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `veteran-fund employee` HAS
    `employed by the owner of a secondary school now` IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed now by an owning body (בעלות) of a secondary school
    `employed by such an owner in the past`       IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by one in the past and no longer
    `insured in a veteran pension fund`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `excess deductions`                           IS A LIST OF `excess deduction`

@desc One deduction for the pension fund beyond 4% plus the rates of section 78יא of the Insurance Supervision Law.
DECLARE `excess deduction` HAS
    `day of the deduction`                IS A NUMBER @desc days from 31 October 2010 (negative before it)
    `amount deducted beyond the rates`    IS A NUMBER @desc shekels deducted beyond 4% plus the section 78יא rates
    `months from deduction to payment`    IS A NUMBER @desc whole months from the deduction to the day the compensation is paid
    `index at the deduction`              IS A NUMBER @desc the consumer price index for the deduction (section 3(א)(3))
    `index at the payment`                IS A NUMBER @desc the consumer price index for the day of payment

@desc Contribution rates as fractions of the salary they are taken on.
DECLARE `veteran contribution rates` HAS
    `veteran employer rate`               IS A NUMBER
    `veteran severance part`              IS A NUMBER
    `veteran benefits part`               IS A NUMBER
    `veteran employee rate`               IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `veteran pension action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the compensation` HAS `compensation paid` IS A NUMBER
    `transfer additional budget for the contributions`

§§ `1 הרקע לפסק הדין`

-- akn:art_1 The background: the ruling of 30.9.09 (סק"כ 1002/04) on new funds, its 1.5% compensation and the veteran-fund employer rate of 15%; the union's further request to extend the compensation to veteran funds; and Mivtachim's request to decide the internal split. Narrative, no rule of this circular.

§§ `2 פסק הדין של בית הדין הארצי לעבודה`

-- Section 2 reports the ruling; section 3 instructs. The ruling's period is
-- encoded as data so that section 3 can be checked against it.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a
`the last day of the ruling's period` MEANS `30 September 2009`

@ref akn:art_2__para_b
`the split the ruling sets` MEANS `veteran contribution rates` 0.15 0.075 0.075 0.055

§§ `3 הנחיות לביצוע פסק הדין`

-- akn:art_3/p1 The lead-in: the owners of the secondary schools are to act as follows; the duties are the paragraphs below.

-- Sections 3(א)(1) and 3(ב)(1): a deduction beyond the rates in 01/01/04 –
-- 30/11/09, or part of that period. Section 2(א) reports the ruling's period
-- as ending on 30/09/09 (F-2010-11_tashaa_01-a); the instruction is encoded
-- as written.
@ref akn:art_3__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_1
`the last day of the instruction's period` MEANS `30 November 2009`

GIVEN d IS AN `excess deduction`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a deduction that earns compensation` d IF
        d's `day of the deduction` AT LEAST `1 January 2004`
    AND d's `day of the deduction` AT MOST `the last day of the instruction's period`

GIVEN d IS AN `excess deduction`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a deduction in the ruling's period` d IF
        d's `day of the deduction` AT LEAST `1 January 2004`
    AND d's `day of the deduction` AT MOST `the last day of the ruling's period`

`the instruction's period runs two months past the ruling's` MEANS
    `the last day of the instruction's period` GREATER THAN `the last day of the ruling's period`
#ASSERT `the instruction's period runs two months past the ruling's`

-- Sections 3(א)(2) and 3(ב)(2): 3.5% for twelve months, or 0.287% a month;
-- the monthly figure is the yearly rate's equivalent rounded to three digits.
@ref akn:art_3__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_2
`the monthly interest rate` MEANS 0.00287
`the yearly interest rate` MEANS 0.035

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `interest factor for` n IS
    IF n AT MOST 0
    THEN 1
    ELSE (1 PLUS `the monthly interest rate`) TIMES `interest factor for` (n MINUS 1)

#ASSERT `the yearly interest rate` MINUS (`interest factor for` 12 MINUS 1) AT MOST 0.00002
#ASSERT `the yearly interest rate` MINUS (`interest factor for` 12 MINUS 1) AT LEAST 0

@ref akn:art_3__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_3
GIVEN d IS AN `excess deduction`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `linkage factor` d IS
    d's `index at the payment` DIVIDED BY d's `index at the deduction`

GIVEN d IS AN `excess deduction`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `compensation for the deduction` d IS
    IF `a deduction that earns compensation` d
    THEN d's `amount deducted beyond the rates`
         TIMES `linkage factor` d
         TIMES `interest factor for` (d's `months from deduction to payment`)
    ELSE 0

GIVEN e IS A `veteran-fund employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the one-off compensation` e IF
        e's `insured in a veteran pension fund`
    AND (e's `employed by the owner of a secondary school now` OR e's `employed by such an owner in the past`)

@export default The one-off compensation a teaching employee insured in a veteran pension fund is owed for over-deduction under circular תשע"א/1, section 3
GIVEN e IS A `veteran-fund employee` @desc the employee and the deductions made beyond the rates
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the compensation` e IS
    IF `entitled to the one-off compensation` e
    THEN sum (map `compensation for the deduction` (e's `excess deductions`))
    ELSE 0

-- Sections 3(א)(4) and 3(ב)(4): a current employee is paid by 23/11/10, a
-- former employee by 23/12/10.
@ref akn:art_3__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_4
GIVEN e IS A `veteran-fund employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the payment deadline for` e IS
    IF e's `employed by the owner of a secondary school now`
    THEN `23 November 2010`
    ELSE `23 December 2010`

GIVEN e IS A `veteran-fund employee`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `veteran pension action`
DECIDE `paying the compensation` e IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the compensation` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the compensation` e
    WITHIN `the payment deadline for` e
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "sections 3(א)(4), 3(ב)(4): the compensation is paid by 23/11/10, or 23/12/10 to a former employee"

@desc What a payment may be counted toward, as sections 3(א)(5) and 3(ב)(5) ask.
DECLARE `compensation use` IS ONE OF
    `the hourly value`
    `pension and other contributions`
    `any other use`

@ref akn:art_3__para_a__subpara_5 akn:art_3__para_b__subpara_5
GIVEN u IS A `compensation use`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the compensation is excluded from` u IF
    CONSIDER u
    WHEN `the hourly value` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `pension and other contributions` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- Section 3(ג): 15% (13.5% + 1.5%) of which 7.5% severance and 7.5%
-- benefits; 5.5% (4% + 1.5%) from the employee; no change in the salary
-- components contributed on.
@ref akn:art_3__para_c
`the veteran-fund rates` MEANS `veteran contribution rates` 0.15 0.075 0.075 0.055

#ASSERT `the veteran-fund rates` EQUALS `the split the ruling sets`
#ASSERT `the veteran-fund rates`'s `veteran severance part` PLUS `the veteran-fund rates`'s `veteran benefits part` EQUALS `the veteran-fund rates`'s `veteran employer rate`
#ASSERT `the veteran-fund rates`'s `veteran employer rate` EQUALS 0.135 PLUS 0.015
#ASSERT `the veteran-fund rates`'s `veteran employee rate` EQUALS 0.04 PLUS 0.015

§§ `4 הבהרה`

@ref akn:art_4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `veteran pension action`
DECIDE `no additional budget for the contributions` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    SHANT `transfer additional budget for the contributions`
    WITHIN 365
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "section 4: no additional budget is transferred, the Ministry's budgeting having included employer contributions of 15%"

-- akn:art_5 The contact line for questions and the title of the attached table of coefficients ("חוזר תשע"א/1 – טבלת מקדמים"), whose rows the document does not carry; no rule.

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and signature; no rule.

-- Worked examples; amounts and index values are round placeholders.
`a current employee with two excess deductions` MEANS
    `veteran-fund employee` WITH
        `employed by the owner of a secondary school now` IS TRUE
        `employed by such an owner in the past`       IS FALSE
        `insured in a veteran pension fund`           IS TRUE
        `excess deductions` IS LIST `excess deduction` (0 MINUS 380) 100 12 100 110,
                                    `excess deduction` (0 MINUS 300) 100 0 100 100

`a deduction in October 2009` MEANS `excess deduction` (0 MINUS 380) 100 12 100 110

-- F-2010-11_tashaa_01-a: a deduction of October 2009 is compensated under
-- section 3 and falls outside the period section 2 reports.
`October 2009 is compensated by the instruction and not by the ruling` MEANS
        `a deduction that earns compensation` `a deduction in October 2009`
    AND (NOT `a deduction in the ruling's period` `a deduction in October 2009`)
#ASSERT `October 2009 is compensated by the instruction and not by the ruling`

#EVAL `the compensation` `a current employee with two excess deductions`
#ASSERT `the compensation` `a current employee with two excess deductions` EQUALS 110 TIMES `interest factor for` 12

#TRACE `paying the compensation` `a current employee with two excess deductions` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the compensation` 113.85 AT 20
#TRACE `paying the compensation` `a current employee with two excess deductions` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the compensation` 113.85 AT 40
